  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rainforest Economic Empowerment and Livelihoods (REAL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the economy and increase sustainable practices of targeted communities in Eastern Indonesia. Another aim is to increase communities&apos; formal access to land to support Indonesia&apos;s social forestry targets. The project will also promote low carbon development principles.</narrative>
  </description>
